{
  "id": "ep41-vo-07",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "H1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "人类打出的第一通电话，第一句话，说的是什么？",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "H1.mp3",
      "bytes": 69006,
      "heard": "人类打出的第一通电话,第一句话,说的是什么?",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.24
    },
    {
      "name": "H2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "答案，要从三千年前说起。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "H2.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "答案要從三千年前說起",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "S1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "商朝人有一句话，想问老天。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "S1.mp3",
      "bytes": 51034,
      "heard": "商朝人有一句话想问老天",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "name": "S2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "火烤龟甲，裂纹就是回答。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "S2.mp3",
      "bytes": 51034,
      "heard": "火烤归家,列文就是回答。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "name": "S3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "刻下的这句问话，留到了今天。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "S3.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "课下的这句问话留到了今天。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "name": "D1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "七五七年，长安被叛军攻破。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "D1.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "757年,长安被判军攻破",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "D2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "杜甫困在城里，不知道家人还在不在。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "D2.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "杜甫困在城里不知道家人还在不在",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "D3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "那年春天，他写下：",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "D3.mp3",
      "bytes": 34315,
      "heard": "那年春天他写下",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "name": "B3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "人类第一通电话的第一句话，是：我想见你。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "B3.mp3",
      "bytes": 71514,
      "heard": "人类第一通电话的第一句话是:「我想见你。」",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.4
    },
    {
      "name": "J1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "中国的第一封电子邮件，写好了。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "J1.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "中国的第一封电子邮件写好了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "name": "J2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "可程序卡住了，整整六天。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "J2.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "可程序卡住了整整六天",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "O1a",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "唱片上，还录着她恋爱时的脑电波和心跳。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "O1a.mp3",
      "bytes": 62318,
      "heard": "唱片上還錄著他戀愛時的腦電波和心跳",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.84
    },
    {
      "name": "O1b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "唱片上，还录着她恋爱时的脑电波，和身体的声音。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "O1b.mp3",
      "bytes": 74021,
      "heard": "唱片上還錄著他戀愛時的腦電波和身體的聲音",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 4.56
    },
    {
      "name": "O3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你最想对谁说一句话？",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "O3.mp3",
      "bytes": 35569,
      "heard": "你最想对谁说一句话。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.16
    },
    {
      "name": "M1",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "[somber] A letter told Samuel Morse his wife had died.",
      "voice": "MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC",
      "voice_id": "MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "M1.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "A letter told Samuel Morse his wife had died.",
      "heard_lang": "en",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "M2",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "[quietly] When he got home, she was already buried.",
      "voice": "MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC",
      "voice_id": "MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "M2.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "When he got home, she was already buried.",
      "heard_lang": "en",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "M3",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Nineteen years later, his telegraph sent words in an instant:",
      "voice": "MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC",
      "voice_id": "MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "status": 200,
